### =========================================================
### VARIÁVEIS DE AMBIENTE (REST Client)
### Obs: Após rodar os requests de login ou criação, copie os
### tokens/UUIDs retornados ou use a captura automática (@name)
### =========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

# Credenciais configuradas no .env (usadas pelo SeedAdmin)
@adminEmail = admin@medclinic.com
@adminPassword = SenhaForte@123

# Tokens (Preenchidos automaticamente pelos requests @name ou manualmente)
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
@secretaryToken = {{loginSecretary.response.body.accessToken}}
@doctorToken = {{loginDoctor.response.body.accessToken}}

# IDs gerados (Preenchidos automaticamente pelos requests @name ou manualmente)
@patientId = {{createPatient.response.body.id}}
@doctorId = {{createDoctor.response.body.id}}
@appointmentId = {{createAppointment.response.body.id}}

### =========================================================
### 1. SAÚDE E AUTENTICAÇÃO (Seção 4.9.2)
### =========================================================

### 1.1 Health Check (Público) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1.2 Login Administrador (Criado via Migration/Seed) - Esperado: 200 OK
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 1.3 Consultar dados do usuário autenticado (/users/me) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### =========================================================
### 2. GESTÃO DE USUÁRIOS (Apenas Admin - RF13)
### =========================================================

### 2.1 Criar Secretária (Perfil: admin) - Esperado: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Joana Secretária",
  "email": "joana@medclinic.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte@123",
  "roles": ["secretary"]
}

### 2.2 Login da Secretária - Esperado: 200 OK
# @name loginSecretary
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joana@medclinic.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte@123"
}

### =========================================================
### 3. PACIENTES (Seção 4.9.3)
### =========================================================

### 3.1 Cadastrar Paciente (Perfis: admin, secretary) - Esperado: 201 Created
# @name createPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Pereira",
  "cpf": "12345678901"
}

### 3.2 Listar Pacientes com paginação e filtro por nome (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?page=1&pageSize=20&name=Carlos
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### 3.3 Buscar Paciente por ID (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### 3.4 Atualizar Nome do Paciente (Perfis: admin, secretary) - Esperado: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Pereira da Silva"
}

### =========================================================
### 4. MÉDICOS E ESCALA DE TRABALHO (Seções 4.9.4 e 4.9.5)
### =========================================================

### 4.1 Cadastrar Médico de forma atômica (Perfil: admin) - Esperado: 201 Created
# @name createDoctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dra. Helena Souza",
  "email": "helena@medclinic.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte@123",
  "crm": "CRM-SC-54321"
}

### 4.2 Login do Médico - Esperado: 200 OK
# @name loginDoctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "helena@medclinic.com",
  "password": "SenhaForte@123"
}

### 4.3 Listar Médicos (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors?page=1&pageSize=20&name=Helena
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### 4.4 Buscar Médico por ID (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors/{{doctorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### 4.5 Configurar Escala de Trabalho do Médico (Perfil: admin) - Esperado: 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/doctors/{{doctorId}}/work-schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shifts": [
    {
      "weekDay": 2,
      "startTime": "08:00",
      "endTime": "12:00",
      "slotDurationMinutes": 30
    },
    {
      "weekDay": 2,
      "startTime": "14:00",
      "endTime": "18:00",
      "slotDurationMinutes": 20
    },
    {
      "weekDay": 4,
      "startTime": "08:00",
      "endTime": "11:00",
      "slotDurationMinutes": 30
    }
  ]
}

### 4.6 Consultar Escala de Trabalho do Médico (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors/{{doctorId}}/work-schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### 4.7 Consultar Agenda do Médico num Período (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors/{{doctorId}}/calendar?from=2026-10-12&to=2026-10-16
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### =========================================================
### 5. AGENDAMENTOS E CICLO DE VIDA (Seção 4.9.7)
### =========================================================

### 5.1 Criar Agendamento (Perfis: admin, secretary) - Esperado: 201 Created
### (2026-10-13 é uma terça-feira -> weekDay: 2, turno 08:00-12:00, slot de 30 min)
# @name createAppointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-13T08:00:00-03:00"
}

### 5.2 Listar Agendamentos com Filtros (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments?doctorId={{doctorId}}&from=2026-10-12&to=2026-10-16&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### 5.3 Buscar Agendamento por ID (Autenticado) - Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 5.4 Iniciar Atendimento: scheduled -> in_progress (Médico responsável ou Admin) - Esperado: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 5.5 Concluir Atendimento: in_progress -> done (Médico responsável ou Admin) - Esperado: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}
